(2398, 'extract', 2, '', 'To draw out; to pull out; to remove forcibly from a fixed position, as by traction or suction, etc.', '提取、拔出、榨出、摘錄', 'https://dictionaryapi.dev/extract', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
