(2633, 'frank', 3, '/fɹæŋk/', 'Honest, especially in a manner that seems slightly blunt; candid; not reserved or disguised.', '坦白的、直率的', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/frank-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
