(2639, 'frequency', 1, '/ˈfɹiːkwənsi/', 'The rate of occurrence of anything; the relationship between incidence and time period.', '頻率、屢次、發生率', 'https://dictionaryapi.dev/frequency', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
