(2910, 'handsome', 3, '/ˈhæn.səm/', '(of people, things, etc) Having a good appearance; good-looking.', '英俊的、端莊的、可觀的', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/handsome-uk.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
