(2918, 'happy', 3, '', 'Having a feeling arising from a consciousness of well-being or of enjoyment; enjoying good of any kind, such as comfort, peace, or tranquillity; blissful, contented, joyous.', '快樂的、幸福的、滿意的', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/happy-au.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
