(2940, 'hat', 1, '[hat]', 'A covering for the head, often in the approximate form of a cone or a cylinder closed at its top end, and sometimes having a brim and other decoration.', '帽子（通常指有邊的）', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/hat-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
