(2945, 'haul', 2, '', 'To transport by drawing or pulling, as with horses or oxen, or a motor vehicle.', '拖運、拉、運送', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/haul-au.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
