(3149, 'hypothesis', 1, '/-əsəs/', 'Used loosely, a tentative conjecture explaining an observation, phenomenon or scientific problem that can be tested by further observation, investigation and/or experimentation. As a scientific term of art, see the attached quotation. Compare to theory, and quotation given there.', '假設、假說', 'https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/media/pronunciations/en/hypothesis-us.mp3', 1, '2026-06-01 14:48:14'),
